  "zh": "# GPT-6 Astra发布展现惊人推理能力，Chromium爆高危RCE漏洞，西藏泥石流致31死531失联。\n## AI与科技\n- **GPT-6 Astra上线**：OpenAI新模型在素数间隔等数学问题上展现惊人推理能力。\n- **形式化费马大定理**：AI辅助数学证明再获突破，Lean 4形式化进程加速。\n- **中国地月立方星座计划**：中国牵头的大科学计划将构建地月空间探测新格局。\n## 安全与开发\n- **Chromium沙箱RCE漏洞**：该漏洞正被积极利用，Chrome用户需警惕紧急更新。\n- **Spotify降低Claude用量**：新工具声称能将Claude Code的token消耗削减90%，开发者福音。\n## 社会民生\n- **西藏吉隆泥石流31死**：灾情严重，救援与失联人员搜救牵动人心。\n- **试药死亡药企怒怼记者**：试药安全与药企态度引发公众对临床试验监管的强烈关注。",
  "en": "# GPT-6 Astra released with strong reasoning, critical Chromium RCE exploited, Tibet mudslide leaves 31 dead and 531 missing.\n## AI & Tech\n- **GPT-6 Astra Out**：OpenAI's new model demonstrates astonishing reasoning by breaking prime gap records.\n- **Fermat AI Proof**：AI-assisted mathematical proofs reach new heights with Lean 4.\n- **Earth-Moon Plan**：China leads a new mega-science project for cislunar space exploration.\n## Security & Dev\n- **Chromium RCE Bug**：An actively exploited sandbox escape vulnerability threatens all Chrome users.\n- **Spotify Portal AI**：A new tool drastically reduces token usage for AI coding assistants.\n## Society\n- **Tibet Mudslide**：Severe disaster in Gyirong prompts massive rescue operations.\n- **Trial Death Probe**：A pharma executive's arrogant response to a trial death raises regulatory concerns."
